39:["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"xb-faq","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"xb-faq","className":"font-heading text-2xl font-bold","children":["Jordan"," cross-border transfer questions"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-3","children":[["$","details","Which border crossing do you use between Saudi Arabia and Jordan?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-[#16A34A]/12 bg-white p-5 open:border-[#16A34A]/35","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#1C1C1C] marker:hidden","children":["$","h3",null,{"className":"inline","children":"Which border crossing do you use between Saudi Arabia and Jordan?"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","children":"Whichever is shorter for your trip. Halat Ammar–Al Mudawwara, about 110 km north of Tabuk, for Amman, Petra and Wadi Rum. Al Durrah–Durra on the Gulf of Aqaba coast, near Haql, for Aqaba and for trips starting on the NEOM coast."}]]}],["$","details","Can I take a private car from Tabuk to Aqaba?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-[#16A34A]/12 bg-white p-5 open:border-[#16A34A]/35","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#1C1C1C] marker:hidden","children":["$","h3",null,{"className":"inline","children":"Can I take a private car from Tabuk to Aqaba?"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","children":"Yes. A driver collects you in Tabuk and drives about 270 km west through Haql and across the Al Durrah crossing to your address in Aqaba. Each passenger completes their own exit and entry checks at the border."}]]}],["$","details","Can you take me from Saudi Arabia to Petra or Wadi Rum?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-[#16A34A]/12 bg-white p-5 open:border-[#16A34A]/35","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#1C1C1C] marker:hidden","children":["$","h3",null,{"className":"inline","children":"Can you take me from Saudi Arabia to Petra or Wadi Rum?"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","children":"Yes. Tabuk to Petra (about 275 km) and Tabuk to Wadi Rum (about 230 km) both cross at Halat Ammar–Al Mudawwara. AlUla to Petra or Wadi Rum can be quoted on request."}]]}],["$","details","What documents do I need to enter Jordan by road from Saudi Arabia?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-[#16A34A]/12 bg-white p-5 open:border-[#16A34A]/35","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#1C1C1C] marker:hidden","children":["$","h3",null,{"className":"inline","children":"What documents do I need to enter Jordan by road from Saudi Arabia?"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","children":"Each passenger needs a valid passport and the right to enter Jordan; Saudi residents generally also need a valid exit and re-entry visa. Entry rules depend on nationality and change, so confirm with official sources before travel. We do not arrange visas."}]]}],["$","details","Can you arrange private transfers inside Jordan?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-[#16A34A]/12 bg-white p-5 open:border-[#16A34A]/35","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#1C1C1C] marker:hidden","children":["$","h3",null,{"className":"inline","children":"Can you arrange private transfers inside Jordan?"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","children":"Yes. Through our partner in Jordan we arrange pre-booked private cars inside Jordan, for example Queen Alia International Airport (AMM) to your Amman hotel, or onward from Amman, Aqaba, Petra or Wadi Rum. Tell us the route and dates on WhatsApp and we confirm a fixed fare before you travel. These are pre-booked private transfers, not street-hail taxis."}]]}],"$L4e"]}]]}]
