4e:["$","details","Can I book a private car in Jordan as well as the cross-border leg?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-[#16A34A]/12 bg-white p-5 open:border-[#16A34A]/35","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#1C1C1C] marker:hidden","children":["$","h3",null,{"className":"inline","children":"Can I book a private car in Jordan as well as the cross-border leg?"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#475569]","children":"Yes. Book the Saudi–Jordan leg and your Jordan transfers together and we quote them in one written offer. For example, Amman to Petra is about 230 km and Aqaba to Petra about 125–130 km by road, according to Visit Jordan, the official Jordan Tourism Board site."}]]}]
